---
/**
 * Why — the reason a non-obvious choice was made (AUTHORING.md §2).
 *
 * Annotate *why this operation / this order* is chosen, not what the step is.
 * "なぜなら両辺を2乗するから" is a restatement and does not belong here.
 *
 * Usage: <Why>…</Why> (plain text or inline math allowed)
 */
---

<div class="why" role="note" aria-label="なぜ？">
  <p class="why__label">なぜ？</p>
  <div class="why__body"><slot /></div>
</div>

<style>
  .why {
    margin: var(--sp-4) 0;
    padding-left: var(--sp-4);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--note);
  }
  .why__label {
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-1);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--note);
  }
  .why__body > :global(:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
